    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Street Ministry (Pastoral Services Contractor).</strong> Before the collar, before the Veil opened for her, Vessa Corran-Dov worked the undercity the way her guild-clan always had - with her hands, her back, and her word kept. Now she works it as a pastor: tending the sick, burying the dead, keeping the peace between crews who would otherwise bleed each other dry over turf. Corp paperwork files her as a <em>pastoral-care specialist</em>; the Ninth Ward calls her the Preacher.</p>",
